    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'uta Ng'utamiida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobaloolan NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida, yamwa geaw gala Yerusalemu ak girukwiidi ng'asheega aba heeda ghaydit ak giramoorsi ng'eanyiida Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak giyeeshi fuga Israeli gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, aniini majeeyeateayeena ak gaydafagu ng'uteanyu aba jeeda labalda ak gaydabwar fuga doobiiweadi ea fuga munyas seara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydabwar fuga sean, aba ng'uteanyu gea miyaasiin ea gea munyas seara. Ghang'eada wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa ea gagul wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghwanal buuneesean gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA, neafagu ng'uteanyu aba jeeda labaldaanyi ak ea majeeteelsa gicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi sawanana Ea orjeeda siida, aba gidagiinyeata guroorooda, aba sawanadeeda aba madeeda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iisiinyaashnyi gideaba ‘ghwasaan anda gisawani?’ Abeeda gajeeshiina, ‘Aba badaydeaba ng'asheesu, aba gideaba ghwahidu ak gaygaba guroorooda nyar nea gang'ang'ariidi geatinga sean ak gaba gurooroani ahiil, nea ghoaleakghleakgh gutung'weaka sean ea gawuurji beega. Ng'ula ghwahidu, ak gaygwasa,’” gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeeshiinean NG'UTAMIIDA: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida, ramoora nea giyeeni gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA eena:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi ang'iing'i orjeeda siida ramoorana, ak gibwari baneaguuka, ng'udi gajeahaat nibiyeenya eara niba samwagu; ng'uta nyaawa gea ghayi sisawan ea gwaramagu gwanuus, ng'uta gaba siida haw ghayi sisawan ea gwaramagu eenuus, nea gwaneaweesa meadajeega sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naayiinyi ghuuteaba ng'udi ghuusiga gealga nyaawa sean, gideaba gwanyara jeesinga nyaawa nea ghoahaada rusooda nyaawa. Aha, sinung' uurjeewana dadamandeeda sishinyi aba gideaba laja gheata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woosa hidaat, una meatkweeda geatinda dugwa, adiing'diing'da geaw una meatkweeda geatinda ghaadaam meatkweeda was sean jea gala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara aniini gaydabwar baneaguuka, eara aniini gaydealang'u nyarasteanyu aniini NG'UTAMIIDA gil, neargu ng'asheanji.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'uta sugoocheanda Babeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobaloolan NG'UTAMIIDA gicha nea gwayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida, ng'oara naweadin iyeenya ak ghwahidu ng'uta sugoocheanda Babeli nea suh asiyeenyean gaygwaleabu ng'eanyiinagi ak ging'waari hich, ak ging'waari uhuuda naweeda weah mujiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gayng'waara naweeda heechea gwasik ng'uta, gawa ea ghwahita mujiineeda Raba bea fuga Amoni, ea naweeda nuut gal mujiineeda mida ghamarda majeek nea Yerusalemu gil mida ng'eanyiida Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba sugoocheanda Babeli ghamiinaada aba ghuuta naweading'su asiyeenyean, was guuyeeda naweadinga sajaada ak ghabwar lagheanga. Gooduumduum geatka ak ghoanyaashta ng'asheega aba heeda sanaamajeagaaschi nea gwasikteawa guwooyda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geacheedida abissa geatindaanyi bea dugwean, ghoahiimu ng'asheega Yerusalemu. Ak ghwayiin dabita jea eenyarjeawa ak gwarukuta gideaba eesin nyeashta ng'ucheeda nea siitiing'diing'da dabita jea eenyarjeawa gidaghuudajeega ak ea sideas ghamarda majeek ea madalajeega neaweesa mujiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheanji aba heeda nyaawa gaygawuurji beeneetkweanduumeeda marachi gil, aba madeeda fuga ghayi aksa habeawooda, ak gayghwanung' eapkaat ng'asheega munyas ak geang'waay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, aba gideaba noanung' eapkaat ng'asheegeagwa munyas. Aba gideaba giidiinyeanyeekeagwa siitahaach, nea eara riing'eegeagwa ea nidaajiit aba sinaweegeagwa, aba gideaba siipkaadeagwa ak gajeang'waanyeagwa aba geatinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ang'iing'i, Ea orjeeda siida muy seara ghayi sisawanyi ea gwaramagu meawa, siida ambal fuga Israeli nea eaweadaang'u ea nihidu aba damanda lasooda bea huuydean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, geanda weastida bea uhuudean, ak gifwakti shiipcheanda suh maygut gawuurji giduurji, adiing'ni dea mida ng'eanyi nea giirareang'u dea mida humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydayam, gaydayam, gaydayam, ak nih maygut ghoaw, bwak ea ghwahidu ninyeeda doobiiwsa abeeda gaydaadaw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'uta ea fuga Amoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak ang'iing'i siida, ramoora nea giyeeni, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA aba badayda fuga Amoni, aba badayda baspaseega nyaawa, rukuta ng'uta, ng'uta sifagu, ak ea sisiy aba gideaba gwanuus, aba gideaba eenung' gwanuus muuchi, nea geenung' gawuurji dadamandeeda– ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "damanda oasiindaawi aba gidasiihiimneegwa bea reengaweega, ea ramoorangeagwa bea ng'uyeega, ng'uta gajea hidaat ghwalach gheata fuga munyas seara ea gea heawa niny. Nihita damanda jea eergweaksiina eaweegeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adeelsiina ng'uta jeeda labaldaanyi, gaydeargweakseegwa aba hooweani ghayi sisinaneegwean, was ng'eanyiida ghayi sijiilseegwean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygoobisa nyarasteanyu badaydaang'u, ak gaydaguuseey beasta nyarasteanyu, ak gaydayiinyi geatinga weajoodiga, nal muuchi lasooda uhuuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gayhuuwa ghweenga jea eayiin jeeda beasta, foojeandaang'u gaygwanda bugusta ng'eanyiida maygudu eepkaanyi, aba gideaba aniini NG'UTAMIIDA neargu ng'asheanji.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.32"
            ]
          }
        }
